---
import { url } from '../../utils/url-utils'
// 全站交互式诊断终端彩蛋与左下角仪器 HUD（逻辑由 /rhine/ui.js 统一驱动，避免每页重复内联）
---

<div
  class="rl-egg"
  id="rl-site-egg"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-labelledby="rl-site-egg-title"
  hidden
>
  <div class="rl-egg__box">
    <p class="rl-egg__kicker">RHINE LAB // INTERACTIVE DIAGNOSTIC CONSOLE</p>
    <p class="rl-egg__title" id="rl-site-egg-title">ACCESS GRANTED</p>
    <p class="rl-egg__line"><span>OBSERVER</span><b>07 / 黯</b></p>
    <p class="rl-egg__line"><span>SECTOR-03 CLOCK</span><b id="rl-egg-clock">--:--:--</b></p>
    <p class="rl-egg__line"><span>OPTICAL MODE</span><b id="rl-egg-theme">STANDBY</b></p>
    <p class="rl-egg__line"><span>STRUCTURE / DEFENSE / ECOLOGY</span><b>98.7% NOMINAL</b></p>
    <p class="rl-egg__bar"><i /></p>

    <div class="rl-egg__cmds" role="group" aria-label="终端快捷指令">
      <a class="rl-egg__cmd" href={url('/random/')}>[01] RANDOM / 随机抽调档案</a>
      <button class="rl-egg__cmd" type="button" id="rl-egg-cmd-theme">[02] OPTICS / 切换亮暗观测</button>
      <a class="rl-egg__cmd" href={url('/operators/')}>[03] PERSONNEL / 研究员名录</a>
      <button class="rl-egg__cmd" type="button" id="rl-egg-cmd-log" aria-pressed="false">[04] LOG / 解密观测者手记</button>
      <button class="rl-egg__cmd rl-egg__cmd--danger" type="button" data-rl-breach>[05] CONTAINMENT / 收容失效演习</button>
    </div>

    <p class="rl-egg__secret" id="rl-egg-secret" hidden>
      “OBSERVER-07 手记：特里蒙的档案柜总比实验台安静。若你在检索框输入 RL-01 至 RL-08，可直接调出八位研究员的内部参数。另：B-07 单元的温控读数最近不太稳定，如果你听见有人键入 IFRIT，请立刻寻找塞雷娅。”
    </p>

    <div class="rl-egg__foot">
      <button class="rl-egg__close" id="rl-site-egg-close" type="button">关闭终端 / ESC</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<aside class="rl-hud" aria-label="莱茵生命快捷仪器铭牌" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <span
    class="rl-hud__emblem"
    style={`--rl-faction-mark: url('${url('/rhine/art/rhine-mark.png')}')`}
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></span>
  <span class="rl-hud__no" aria-hidden="true">07<small>ARCHIVE</small></span>
  <div class="rl-hud__ticks" role="group" aria-label="快速光学与终端控制">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="rl-hud__tick"
      data-rl-hud-theme="light"
      aria-label="切换至昼间暖纸模式"
      aria-pressed="false"
      title="DAY / 暖纸模式"
    ></button>
    <button
      type="button"
      class="rl-hud__tick"
      data-rl-hud-theme="dark"
      aria-label="切换至夜间墨绿模式"
      aria-pressed="false"
      title="NIGHT / 墨绿模式"
    ></button>
    <button
      type="button"
      class="rl-hud__tick rl-hud__tick--term"
      data-rl-open-egg
      aria-label="打开莱茵诊断终端"
      title="TERMINAL / 诊断终端"
    ></button>
  </div>
</aside>
